UID:20261031T150900-20261031T150900-2386@acudmachtneu.de
SUMMARY:Psychopomp
DESCRIPTION:Psychopomp\nSA 31.10.2026\, 20H ACUD Club\nPresale: https://pl.ra.co/events/2552259\n\nSXSE × Chinabot × _Subkontinent welcome you to a night of mediation between infra and ultra\, nether and heavens\, truths and majicks.\n\nAt sandhya\, the hour that belongs to neither day nor night\, the membranes grow porous twixt the living and their ancestors\, the waking and the dreaming\, this world and the one just beside it. Allow the pilandok\, the mouse-deer\, shapeshifter and crosser of boundaries\, to escort you through voids and shines. Follow close\, but never too close\, and trust the path it takes.\n\nCome sway with us on a night that yearns for transformation\, transition and trickery.\n\nLeave your reds at home\, lest you are lost before you reach the temporary shrine of our collective making.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><strong>Psychopomp<br />\nSA 31.10.2026\, 20H ACUD Club<br />\nPresale: </strong><a href=https://pl.ra.co/events/2552259 rel=noopener target=_blank>https://pl.ra.co/events/2552259</a></p>\n<p>SXSE × Chinabot × _Subkontinent welcome you to a night of mediation between infra and ultra\, nether and heavens\, truths and majicks.</p>\n<p>At sandhya\, the hour that belongs to neither day nor night\, the membranes grow porous twixt the living and their ancestors\, the waking and the dreaming\, this world and the one just beside it. Allow the pilandok\, the mouse-deer\, shapeshifter and crosser of boundaries\, to escort you through voids and shines. Follow close\, but never too close\, and trust the path it takes.</p>\n<p>Come sway with us on a night that yearns for transformation\, transition and trickery.</p>\n<p>Leave your reds at home\, lest you are lost before you reach the temporary shrine of our collective making.</p>\n
URL:https://acudmachtneu.de/events/psychopomp/
